# {{ title }}

## Tags

Tag anything with `#`: #index #how-to
Nest tags with `/`: #project/web, #project/mobile, #area/research
Tags can also go in front matter, as in this note's `tags: [index]`.
Numbers alone aren't tags, so issue #42 stays plain text. Neither is C# or https://example.com/#intro.

## Linking by name

Links resolve by file name or alias, from anywhere in the workspace:

- [[project-alpha]] finds `projects/project-alpha.yamd`.
- [[Alpha]] finds the same note through its alias.
- [[ada]] and [[grace]] are people notes.
- [[ideas#Pricing]] links to a heading.
- [[ideas#^pricing-model]] links to a single paragraph (a block reference).
- [[Weekly Review]] doesn't exist yet. Following it offers to create it.

## Embeds

Embed a whole note, a section, a single block, or an image:

![[ideas#Pricing]]

![[ideas#^pricing-model]]

![[../assets/architecture.svg]]{width=360}

## Block IDs

End a paragraph or list item with ` ^id` to make it linkable. ^home-intro

- Each block ID must be unique in its note. ^home-rule
- Link with [[home#^home-rule]], embed with an exclamation mark in front.

## Backlinks

Open the YAMD sidebar while this note is active to see every note that links here. [[project-alpha]], [[project-beta]] and today's daily note all link back to this page.

